The files ffmpeg-core.js and ffmpeg-core.wasm in this directory are the
single-thread build of FFmpeg published as @ffmpeg/core 0.12.6
(https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm).

That build is configured with --enable-gpl and without --enable-version3,
so it is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2.0 or
later. The TS Inspector sources stay under the MIT License. A
dist/ts-inspector.html that embeds this core is distributed under GPL-2.0
as a whole, and whoever hosts it must offer the corresponding source from
the same place. Build with `python3 build.py --no-ffmpeg` to leave the core
out; that page stays MIT only.

Source for this build: https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg and
https://github.com/ffmpegwasm/ffmpeg.wasm/tree/main/packages/core
